SUMMARY:BARRY "THE FISH" MELTON BAND - Rancho Debut!
DESCRIPTION:DINNER SHOW with BARRY “THE FISH” MELTON BAND – Rancho Debut!\nHAVING PLAYED TOGETHER SINCE THE EARLY 1980s\, THE BARRY “THE FISH” MELTON BAND CONTINUES TO UPHOLD THE TRADITION OF SAN FRANCISCO ROCK & ROLL THAT PUT THE BAY AREA ON THE MUSICAL MAP IN THE MID 1960s.  THEIR MUSIC IS BEST SUMMED UP BY A LINE FROM ONE OF THEIR SONGS “WHEN THE BAND STARTS PLAYING\, I DON’T WANT TO STOP!!” \n 
